---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Cat from '../components/Cat.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import Filters from '../components/Filters.astro';
import PostCard from '../components/PostCard.astro';
import AdSlot from '../components/AdSlot.astro';
import { getPosts } from '../lib/posts';
import { site } from '../config';
const posts = await getPosts();
---
<Base>
  <section class="hero"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot"></span> DEVELOPER’S NOTES</p><h1>배우고, 만들고,<br class="mobile-break"/> <span>기록합니다.</span></h1><p class="hero-description">개발하며 마주한 문제와 해결 과정,<br class="mobile-break"/> 작지만 유용한 발견들을 나눕니다.</p></div><div class="hero-cat"><Cat variant="hero"/></div></section>
  <Filters/>
  <div class="home-grid"><section class="posts-section" aria-labelledby="recent-heading"><div class="section-heading"><h2 id="recent-heading">최근 글 <span class="count" id="result-count">{String(posts.length).padStart(2,'0')}</span></h2><a class="text-link" href="/posts/">모든 글 보기 <Icon name="arrow" size={17}/></a></div><div class="post-list">{posts.map((post,i) => <PostCard post={post} featured={i===0}/>)}</div><div class="empty-state" id="no-results" hidden><p>아직 이 카테고리에 글이 없어요.</p><span>다른 카테고리의 기록을 둘러보세요.</span></div></section>
  <aside class="sidebar"><section class="profile-card"><div class="profile-top"><div class="avatar"><Cat/></div><div><h2>NyanPunch<span class="brand-dot">.</span></h2><p>직접 만들며 배우는 개발자</p></div></div><p class="profile-skills">Python · OpenCV · 데이터 분석</p><div class="profile-bottom"><div class="social-links"><a href={site.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="GitHub 프로필"><Icon name="github" size={21}/></a><a href={`mailto:${site.email}`} aria-label="이메일 보내기"><Icon name="mail" size={21}/></a></div><a class="text-link" href="/about/">소개 더 보기 <Icon name="arrow" size={16}/></a></div></section>
  <section class="project-sidebar"><p class="eyebrow">SELECTED WORKS</p><h2>진행한 프로젝트</h2><a href="/projects/1/">차량 사각지대 공유 시스템 <Icon name="external" size={18}/></a><a href="/projects/2/">딥러닝 기반 음악 기호 인식 <Icon name="external" size={18}/></a><a href="/projects/3/">POS 데이터 분석 <Icon name="external" size={18}/></a><div class="project-sidebar-footer"><a class="text-link" href="/projects/">프로젝트 전체 보기 <Icon name="arrow" size={16}/></a></div></section>
  <AdSlot/>
  <a class="rss-note" href="/rss.xml"><span class="rss-symbol" aria-hidden="true">◔</span><div><strong>새로운 기록을 놓치지 않도록</strong><span>RSS로 블로그 구독하기 ↗</span></div></a>
  </aside></div>
</Base>
